      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-14T11:54:54.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹63.53 (vs ₹46.43 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹63.53 (up from ₹46.43 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹560.9b (up 27% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹30.2b (up 37% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.4% (up from 5.0% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.1% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 8.1% growth forecast for the Auto industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 28% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 41% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
