      "date": "2026-03-12T07:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "TVS Motor Company Launches TVS Orbiter V1 and Introduces Battery-As-A-Service",
      "body": "TVS Motor Company  strengthened its electric vehicle portfolio with the launch of TVS Orbiter V1 with 1.8 kWh — the most accessible electric scooter in the company’s lineup. The company also introduced Battery-As-A-Service (BaaS) across its EV portfolio, offering customers a new and flexible ownership model. With the addition of TVS Orbiter V1 and the introduction of Battery-As-A-Service, TVS Motor’s EV scooter range now starts at INR 499,990 (ex-showroom Delhi, inclusive of PM e-Drive). The BaaS model lowers the upfront cost, while offering customers long-term battery assurance and peace of mind. Customers who prefers the TVS Orbiter V1 without BaaS, can purchase it at INR 845,000 (ex-showroom Delhi, inclusive of PM e-Drive). TVS Orbiter V1, powered by a 1.8 kWh battery, is designed to ma",
      "keyDevTypeId": "41",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
