      "body": "MIH Investments One B.V. entered into share purchase agreement to acquire an additional unknown stake in Roppen Transportation Services Private Limited from TVS Motor Company Limited (BSE:532343) for INR 1.4 billion on November 6, 2025. As part of the acquisition, MIH Investments One B.V. agreed to acquire 10 number of Equity Shares and 11,988 number of Series D Compulsory Convertible Preference Shares of Roppen Transportation Services Private Limited from TVS Motor Company Limited for a combined consideration of INR 1.4 billion. In separate transaction, Accel India VIII (Mauritius) Limited also entered into share purchase agreement to acquire 11,997 number of Series D Compulsory Convertible Preference Shares of Roppen Transportation Services Private Limited from TVS Motor Company Limited ",
