    {
      "id": "6704e731-1b23-49fc-97de-b8ed38e17c2f",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-02-07T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "TVS Motor Company Announces Management Changes",
      "body": "TVS Motor Company appointed Madhu Srivastava as president and group head of human resources. Srivastava has cross-industry experience spanning natural resources, oil and gas, financial services, telecom and manufacturing. Prior to joining TVSM, she was the global CHRO of Vedanta Resources. The company thanks R Anandakrishnan who has devoted 38 years to TVS and has been instrumental in building the strong people foundations, values and HR systems. As the CHRO of Vedanta Resources, Srivastava led enterprise-wide people strategy and major HR integrations, including the acquisition of Cairn India and other businesses. Previously, she served as CHRO of Cairn Oil & Gas and group head of talent acquisition, diversity and inclusion, building global leadership pipelines and early-talent programmes.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
